+   [gha-ci-img]: https://github.com/CliMA/<Package>.jl/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg?branch=main
+   [gha-ci-url]: https://github.com/CliMA/<Package>.jl/actions/workflows/ci.yml?query=branch%3Amain
